text Naranja_NavelIsland_ContestLobby_Text_08177141 {
    "They had a sketch of my POKéMON up\non the wall over there, but they\lchanged it with a new one already.\pI’m going to enter my HANA in CONTESTS\nso we can get her sketch up again!"
}

text Naranja_NavelIsland_ContestLobby_Text_081771F2 {
    "Hi, are you making any オカキクケS?\pYou should come by with a bunch of\nBERRIES sometime."
}

text Naranja_NavelIsland_ContestLobby_Text_08177246 {
    "You see how they display a sketch of\na CONTEST winner here?\pI sketch them!\pIf any of your POKéMON wins a CONTEST,\nI’d gladly make a sketch of it!"
}

text Naranja_NavelIsland_ContestLobby_Text_081772D8 {
    "Hello! Congratulations!\pI’ve put up a sketch of your POKéMON\nright here for everyone to see!"
}
